@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms & Conditions";
}

<section class="py-5 bg-white border-bottom">
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Terms and Conditions</h1>
        <p class="text-muted mb-0">Review corporate terms governing account usage, checkout pricing, and warehouse collection options.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5">
    <div class="container fs-7 text-muted" style="max-width: 900px; line-height: 1.6;">
        <h5 class="font-weight-bold text-dark mb-3">1. Account Terms</h5>
        <p>By registering on the VMR portal, you agree to provide authentic name, address, and mobile records. Any verification discrepancy can trigger account suspension.</p>

        <h5 class="font-weight-bold text-dark mt-4 mb-3">2. Pricing Integrity & ERP Sync</h5>
        <p>While we make every attempt to ensure live stock and pricing synchronization with our central ERP database, VMR reserves the right to cancel orders arising from erroneous database parameters, tax calculations, or incorrect specifications.</p>

        <h5 class="font-weight-bold text-dark mt-4 mb-3">3. Payment & Settlement</h5>
        <p>Payment terms are determined by the selected method: Cash on Delivery or Bank Transfer. Orders placed using Bank Transfer require transaction receipt validation before items are dispatched from our warehouse.</p>

        <h5 class="font-weight-bold text-dark mt-4 mb-3">4. Intellectual Property</h5>
        <p>VMR Power Tools, logos, and catalogs displayed on this portal are owned by VMR. Third-party supplier brands (Bosch, DeWalt, Makita, Metabo) are the property of their respective manufacturers.</p>
    </div>
</section>
